  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Područje reproduktora nikad nije dobilo veličinu, pa reprodukcija nije pokrenuta.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Sam reproduktor — dekodiranje, titlovi i zvuk. GPLv2 ili noviji.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Projekt ne hostira, ne vodi, ne podržava i ne preporučuje nijedan izvor te ne dijeli njihov popis.",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Izdanje ne sadrži ažuriranje za ovu platformu.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Izvor je to već dohvatio — reproducira se odmah i ne ostavlja ništa na ovom uređaju",
  "The torrent engine accepted the file but gave it no id.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The torrent engine accepted the file but gave it no id.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Torrent motor prihvatio je magnet, ali mu nije dodijelio ID.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Torrent motor, ugrađen u aplikaciju. Pod MIT licencom.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Torrent stream još nije spreman (motor je vratio HTTP {status}). Možda još dohvaća metapodatke od parnjaka.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Ažuriranje nije bilo moguće instalirati: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Ovdje jedva ima mjesta za jedan film. Priključi USB disk u uređaj — formatiran kao FAT32, što prihvaća svaki Android uređaj — i pojavit će se iznad da na njega preuzimaš.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Nema računa za prijavu i ništa se ne sinkronizira na poslužitelj. Što gledaš, dokle si stigao, tvoji favoriti i tvoj popis za gledanje sve se sprema na ovaj uređaj i nikad ga ne napušta. Sinkronizacija među zaslonima je u planu; do tada je sigurnosna kopija ispod način da knjižnica prijeđe.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "U tvojoj mapi dokumenata nema {file}. Kopiraj jedan onamo i pokušaj ponovno.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Ova veza trenutačno naplaćuje promet.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Ova veza trenutačno ne naplaćuje promet.",
  "This content is rated {rating} and exceeds your parental control settings.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This content is rated {rating} and exceeds your parental control settings.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Dekoder ovog uređaja odustao je od datoteke. Obično je krivac zvuk: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) i DTS nisu licencirani u sistemskom webprikazu, pa se izdanje s takvim zvukom reproducira kao slika bez zvuka, ili nikako. Izdanje x264 s AAC zvukom će se reproducirati.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Ova datoteka ima jedan zvučni zapis.",
  "This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.",
